msgctxt "148"
msgid "Have you seen a miniature... uh, kaninchen dachshund around here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Hehehe. Ownin' a dog is great, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"But you gotta understand how they feel, y'know? Otherwise you'll never be "
"able to really take care of your dog."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"This dachshund you're lookin' for... She have a name tag that says Newton?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "That's the one."
msgstr "Proprio lui."

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Hehehe. Kids these days just don't know how to take care of their dogs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"They think they're the ones in charge, but the dog's really the one callin' "
"the shots. You know what I mean, don't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "Dogs, well... They just wanna be free, like this cute little guy here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "The dog you're lookin' for left here a little while ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "I see... Thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"Take good care of that dog of yours... And she's a miniature, not a "
"kaninchen."
msgstr ""

